<title>CHINA: China oil production seen at 165 mln T oil in 2000.</title>
<headline>China oil production seen at 165 mln T oil in 2000.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>China is seen producing 165 million tonnes of crude oil and 25 billion cubic metres of natural gas in the year 2000, the Market Daily said on Friday.</p>
<p>China produced 158.51 million tonnes of crude oil in 1996, a rise of 6.37 percent compared with 1995 and expects to produce 142 million of crude oil this year, earlier figures show.</p>
<p>Natural gas output totalled 19.904 billion cubic metres in 1996, up 15.74 percent compared with 1995 and China expects to produce 17 billion cubic metres of natural gas on land this year, the figures show.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (86-10) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
